%% Deployment architecture — adopted owner-amended baseline; unresolved parameters remain in the Open Decisions register.
flowchart TD
  Browser[Authenticated single-owner React browser] --> HTTPS[HTTPS / static web delivery]
  HTTPS --> API[FastAPI process]
  API -->|SSE updates / refresh| Browser
  API --> PG[(PostgreSQL)]
  Workers[Worker / scheduler processes: same backend build] --> PG
  Workers --> Storage[(Durable analytical / artifact storage)]
  Workers --> Markets[Approved data providers]
  Workers --> Models[Approved model providers]
  Workers --> Paper[Paper adapter only]
  Research[Resource-limited research process] --> Storage
  Research --> Read[Scoped operational reads]
  Read --> PG
  Secrets[Server-side secret references] -.-> API
  Secrets -.-> Workers
  API --> Telemetry[Redacted telemetry / audit linkage]
  Workers --> Telemetry
  PG --> Backup[Backup / tested restore]
  Storage --> Backup
